              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. May ride a warhorse (+3) and wear light armour (+3). Drilled. Stubborn. A senior officer (comes, dux, etc.) to assist the general and command units, brigades or small armies. (Fall of the West p.45)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
