              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Roman citizens in arms: hunting gear, farm tools and other sharp implements treated as hand weapons. Light Infantry. May not have standards or musicians in the unit; may have a Roman infantryman from one of the above types as a leader. (Fall of the West p.46)</characteristic>
