            <profile id="22fc-ef5b-1201-f3ac" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="37b4-aae5-6830-d590" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Shock chariot with hinged scythes drawn by cataphract horses. Hand weapons, kontos, heavy armour, bucklers and barding (statistics already include bonuses for equipment). No options. D3+2 automatic hits when charging in addition to normal attacks. Destroyed if it breaks from close combat (it is not destroyed after charging). Move as a chariot. 0-2. Roman artillery is otherwise as in the rulebook (p.124). (Fall of the West p.48)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="41f5-7094-8e09-ea1c" name="Currus Drepanus" hidden="false" targetId="d022-f542-22e9-c212" type="rule"/>
