              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bolt Thrower: range 36", Strength 4 (-1 per rank), no save, D3 wounds per hit. Two-man crew, swords, stubborn. Carroballista (+10): moves 8", cannot fire on the turn it moves, cannot march or charge. Roman artillery as in the rulebook Roman list (Fall of the West p.48; rulebook pp.179-181). Special Units: at most a quarter of the army's points. (Fall of the West p.179-181 (rulebook))</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
